WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.652
The fields are full. But the island has gone quiet.

2
00:00:04.722 --> 00:00:09.542
<v Dev>Dev: The nature lens shows it. No hedges. So the bees and the deer have left.

3
00:00:09.612 --> 00:00:12.853
<v Florence>Florence: Oops. You said as much as possible. So I took it all.

4
00:00:12.923 --> 00:00:15.828
<v Posy>Posy: Enough food. And keep the hedges for the bees.

5
00:00:15.898 --> 00:00:19.729
<v Florence>Florence: An orchard, beehives and hedges. Enough for everyone. Checked!

6
00:00:19.799 --> 00:00:24.572
Hedges are homes and safe paths for wildlife. Enough is better than most.

7
00:00:24.642 --> 00:00:28.881
And an AI does what you say, not what you mean. So tell it what to keep.
